>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> does it\nviolate?</li>\n<li>Compute the dimension of each of the two commutants, and explain why\nthey are equal.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch10-canonical-forms/04-real-jordan-and-weyr-forms.html"}